<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman cuts Guinness, GrandMet.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman cuts Guinness, GrandMet.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guinness Plc and Grand Metropolitan Plc were cut to &quot;outperform&quot; from &quot;buy&quot; at Lehman Brothers, a research note from analyst John Wakeley at the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
